# WriteToStatusbar

This function allows you to write to the status bar:
                                                    
~~~
{r}←{color} WriteToStatusbar (n text)
~~~

`color` is optional and might be a single scalar, including negative ones, or three-item vector.
Refer to the Dyalog GUI help on BCol for details.

Calling this function makes sense only from a user-defined callback. In such cases the `n` namespace
will be provided as an argument to the callback.
